@startuml 洪水冲击建链期
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ArrowColor #5A5A5A
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DCE9FB
skinparam SequenceParticipantFontColor #1F2933
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0B400
skinparam NoteFontColor #5C4A00

title 建链期冲击:持续输出淹没首帧导致 handshake timeout

participant "MCP\n(establishSession)" as M
participant "设备 shell\n(持续输出)" as S
participant "设备 rz\n(首帧)" as R

== 挂旁路后发命令 ==

M -> S  : rz 命令
S --> M : 回显 "rz\r\n waiting to receive."

== 洪水场景:日志先于首帧涌入 ==

loop 洪水持续输出 (logcat / dmesg / top)
  S --> M : 日志行 × N (每行几十~几百字节)
end loop

M -> M  : 轮询 preBuffer\nfindZmodemHeaderStart 未命中
M -> M  : detectHandshakeFailure\n缓冲 < 256B 时容忍, 继续等

R --> M : ZRINIT 首帧 (迟到)
M -> M  : findZmodemHeaderStart\n从日志垃圾中定位 2a 2a 18
M -> M  : parse(preBuffer.slice(headerStart))\n建链成功

== 极端场景:洪水吞掉首帧或超时 ==

alt 首帧被洪水稀释, 5s 内未到
  M -> M  : HANDSHAKE_TIMEOUT_MS 到期
  M --> M : throw "handshake timeout"
else 日志行内恰好出现 CAN 连击 / 错误文本
  M -> M  : detectHandshakeFailure 误命中
  M --> M : throw "handshake failed: <原因>"
end alt

note over M, S
  256B 垃圾上限与 5s 超时是
  建链期的两道硬门:洪水越猛,
  首帧越容易被挤出窗口
end note

@enduml
